---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Inkuna — a minimalist book reader"
  description="Inkuna is a minimalist book reader where ink meets moonlight. EPUB and more, first-class CJK typography, native on iOS and Android. Open source under AGPL-3.0."
  og={{
    title: "Inkuna",
    description: "A minimalist book reader where ink meets moonlight.",
  }}
>
  <main>
    <svg class="moon" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
      <circle cx="66" cy="38" r="26" fill="var(--paper)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <span class="vertical-accent" lang="ja" aria-hidden="true">墨と月のあいだ</span>
    <h1>Inkuna</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A minimalist book reader where ink meets moonlight.</p>
    <p>
      Crafted, quiet, literary. Inkuna keeps your library close and stays out of
      the way of the page — no accounts, no noise, just reading.
    </p>
    <ul class="features">
      <li><span class="mark">✦</span> EPUB, MOBI, AZW3 (DRM-free), TXT, and PDF today; CBZ/CBR comics planned.</li>
      <li><span class="mark">✦</span> First-class CJK typography — vertical writing and CJK-aware search are core goals, not afterthoughts.</li>
      <li><span class="mark">✦</span> Fully native on iOS and Android, sharing one Rust core.</li>
      <li><span class="mark">✦</span> Free and open source under <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html">AGPL-3.0</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="platforms">
      Inkuna is in active development. Follow along or build it yourself on
      <a href="https://github.com/PythonShe/Inkuna">GitHub</a> — App Store and
      Play Store releases will land when the reading experience earns them.
    </p>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 Inkuna</span>
    <a href="https://github.com/PythonShe/Inkuna">Source</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/PythonShe/Inkuna/blob/main/LICENSE">License</a>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    flex: 1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .moon {
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .vertical-accent {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.55em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    opacity: 0.6;
    user-select: none;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .features li {
    padding: 1.1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .features .mark {
    flex: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .platforms {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  footer {
    max-width: 40rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .vertical-accent {
      display: none;
    }
    main {
      padding-top: 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
